        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-05T17:19:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sadly I was unable to preorder Villains last year. My best hope was a preorder with coolstuffinc that had luckily provided the promos for the previous expansion. Sadly no luck. My preorder arrived with no promos. Any chance anyone out there has a spare set they'd be willing to part with.</p><p>I'd be willing to pay a reasonable amout or swap for another promo set. I have an extra set of either the</p><p>a) Santa Guise-Terminiation promos</p><p>or</p><p>b) Darkwatch- Gloomweaver, and Spite promos</p><p>On ebay someone has the set up for $74.99 (w/shippng :P). That is not reasonable. I've been a fan and supporter since 1st Edition and these are the only things I'm missing, except for Kvothe (forot about him), and would love to complete the set.</p>",
